      "title": "Dépendance aux remboursements Medicare et Medicaid",
      "category": "Réglementaire",
      "severity": 4,
      "score_rationale": "Note 4/5 : haut de la section Operations, \"a substantial portion of our dialysis revenues are generated from patients who have Medicare\". Dependance structurelle aux payeurs publics, langage \"material adverse effect\", mais sans pourcentage precis : pas 5.",
